$(L,R)$ asserts $10^{12}(x-l)\ge L$ and
$10^{12}(h-x)\ge R$; the p upper margin at $(3,1)$ is exactly zero.
Every entry follows by substitution in (17.1)--(17.4) and cross multiplication.

